      "notes": "The Toungoo article splits the dynasty into the First Toungoo Empire (1510-1599) and the Nyaungyan Restoration (1599-1752), which ruled from Ava. So the name Ava on the map after 1599 is this dynasty's seat, not the independent Kingdom of Ava that ended in 1555 -- which is why the alias is windowed and not bare."
